   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "1999-06-29",
   "text": "Older Workers Pension Protection Act of 1999 - Amends the Internal Revenue Code and the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974 (ERISA) to prohibit plan amendments that reduce future accrued benefits for years of service for participants in defined benefit plans with 100 or more members."
  }
